        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Historical Geography and the Feudal World - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "### Problem 4: Competing Claims\nTwo lords can both have legitimate (to them) claims to the same territory.\nNeither claim is necessarily fraudulent — they derive from different transfer events."
    },
