        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "### Problem 5: Ecclesiastical Enclaves\nBishoprics and abbeys hold land as quasi-secular lords.\nThe bishop is both a spiritual official (appointed by Church) and a feudal lord (owes knight service).\nThe Investiture Controversy was entirely about this contradiction."
    },
